braincrawl

fn print_artifact_tree(artifacts: &[serde_json::Value])


library list --text — a tree instead of the flat one-line-per-result rendering the generic envelope printer gives (artifacts have no id/title for it to display anyway). A dangling parent (pointing at a role/version not present in this listing) is shown at the top level, annotated "unknown".

